{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run, Jump, Escape \u2013 But Never Fall!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DELETE</strong> is a high-speed parkour platformer that tests your reflexes, timing, and precision. Dodge deadly traps, master gravity-defying obstacles, and race through uniquely themed maps designed to push your limits.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795540/extras/b0495ec29474b140a755db09ff8797f6.avif?t=1751979324\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795540/extras_big/b0495ec29474b140a755db09ff8797f6.avif?t=1751979324 width=800 height=434 /></span>\ud83c\udf0d Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Themes:</strong> Dash across the Moon, sprint through Ancient Egypt, leap through a cartoon world, and navigate a neon-drenched cyberpunk city \u2013 each with its own unique visual style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Levels:</strong> Carefully crafted obstacle courses designed to challenge both casual and hardcore players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards:</strong> Compete for the fastest times and climb to the top of the global rankings with full Steam leaderboard integration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluid Movement System:</strong> Enjoy smooth parkour mechanics including double jumps, wall runs, and more for a seamless experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Variety:</strong> Every map features a distinct artistic identity \u2013 from minimalism to mythology \u2013 offering a fresh experience every time.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795540/extras/f249b1e84db06359e8dcbc0f887348c2.poster.avif?t=1751979324\" widt